  "description": "*\"No. You'll regret it. You and I... It doesn't make sense.\"\n\n\"Engagement? That's ridiculous. Is it some kind of arranged marriage or something?\"*\n\nIt's not like it's a chaebol family or some unavoidable business merger or anything. They're just neighbors who lived in the same apartment building. How could she have gotten involved with a guy like this? It wasn't her intention. It was entirely her parents' will! With the campus romance she'd been dreaming of right in front of her, Da-Kyung suddenly gets engaged to her childhood friend. Huh? An engagement at this age? And to Ma Seong-Jae, who's her testicle friend and a notorious slut?\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Dongjeongnam Danpyeonseon (동정남 단편선) Collection.*",
